<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="2.6">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">Tutsa: Bible Translation 1st Edition</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">2 Timothi</para>
  <para style="toc1">TIMOTHI suh Pool ih Taklih raang arah Le</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timothi</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Tim</para>
  <para style="mt1">TIMOTHI</para>
  <para style="mt2">Suh Pool Ih Taklih Raang Arah Le</para>
  <para style="imt">Ephangjatjih</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Timothi suh Pool Liwang Leeraang</char> adi ehan ah Timothi suh Pool ih heh no adoleh heh moot roongte ih thun ano heh ngiija tiit loong baattaan arah je ah. Hesot hemat ah enaan tiit. Timothi suh Jisu Kristo haaki ah ramram ih chap uh ih baattaan ha, eno Ehak Banlam nyia Ruurang Ese le ni raangha loong tiit ah nyootsoot suh heh ah nyootte nyia Rangte mootkaatte et re thukta, chamanaangte nyia heh miksukte loong pandi ah.</para>
  <para style="ip">Timothi suh emoong tiitbaatte nyia lalangka jengkhaap di daanmuite re nawa haloh ih tong uh ih baatta, erah loong ah ese tah angka, erah nang ih bah, erah boichaatte ah echiike ba etthuk ah.</para>
  <para style="ip">Erah loong damdi, Timothi suh arah leeraangte wah roidong nyia heh reeraang pakna loong ah enyootsok theng ih baat ha—heh hanpi tiit, heh toongtang tiit, heh minchan tiit, enaan tiit nyia phate joonnaam di chamnaang arah tiit loong ah.</para>
  <para style="iot">Hemong Dowa Jatjih</para>
  <para style="io1">Ephangjatjih <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Ephoongpha nyia eroorang <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 1:3-2:13">1:3—2:13</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Erenbaat nyia echoophaan tiit <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 2:14-4:5">2:14—4:5</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Pool heteewah ru arang tiit <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 4:6-18">4:6-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">Hethoonhemat<char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TI 4:19-22">4:19-22</ref>) </char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ngah Pool, jiin nawa arah le ah, Jisu Kristo kaamwah Rangte thungpun jun ih danje hang ah, eno Jisu damdoh roop ih no heh ih kakhamta roidong tiit ah tumbaat suh daapkaat tahang—</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:2 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 16:1">Esm 16:1</ref>
      </char>
    </note> Nga sah, Timothi suh:</para>
  <para style="p">Seng loong wah Rangte nyia Teesu Jisu Kristo ih an suh heh tenthet, minchan nyia semroongroong ah toom koho.</para>
  <para style="s">Lakookmi nyia chaankot tiit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Ngah ih Rangte suh lakookmi liihang, sengte sengwah ih soom rumta ah likhiik ngah ih uh thung atak esa nawa ih heh rang ah soomhang. Sen loong ah rangwuung rangphe nga rangsoom nawa ih jen samthun rumha eno heh suh lakookmi liihang. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Ngah ih sen mikse janhaat tan ah samthun hang, eno sen japtup suh rapne ih ramlang, eno ba ngah tenroon ang ang. <verse number="5" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 16:1">Esm 16:1</ref></char></note> Ngah ih an wih Lois nyia an nuh Unis seklilih ih hanpi nyuuta a likhiik ih sen hanpi ah samthun hang. Ngah ih thunhang sen uh emamah heh ih hanpi lan. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Erah thoih ansuh baat hala nga lak ih taajoh taha adi an suh Rangte ih thaangmuh lakot kotaho ah ban maak ruh et uh. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Tumeah Rangte ih kotahe Chiiala rah ih seng ah choophoot ih hoon suh tah angka, erah nang ih bah, heh Chiiala ih seng suh chaan aphaan , minchan, nyia seng teeteewah jen soksam theng ah kotahe.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Erah thoih, Teesu haaki angsuh larakri theng; adoleh Kristo tungthoih ngah phaatak ni tonglang asuh uh larakri theng. Erah nang ih bah, Ruurang Ese raangtaan ih cham anaang jen hui suh, chaan kotaho jun ih cham anaang etheng. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Seng ah heh mina ih hoon suh piipang hali nyia poon hali ah langla, seng mootkaat thoi ih tah angka, erah nang ih bah ah heh mootkaat raang ih heh tenthet je thoih. Saapoot maang thok ra ngakhoni Jisu Kristo mendi ba seng suh erah tenthet ah kohali, <verse number="10" style="v"/>enoothong, amadi seng Pangte nyi seng Teesu, Jisu Kristo ra taha rah ih dongjat thuk hali. Heh ih etek chaan aphaan ah matsiit etta nyia ruurangese jun ih latek roidong ah dong thukta. <verse number="11" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 2:7">1Tim 2:7</ref></char></note> Ruurang Ese ah tumbaat suh Rangte ih heh kaamwah nyia nyootte et danjoh tahang, <verse number="12" style="v"/>eno ngah ah erah loong ah thoih chamnaang lang. Ang abah uh, ngah tarakri kang, tumeah ngah o suh laalom lang erah ejat ehang, eno ngah ih kamkam jat hang heh ih heh Herangwuung maanglang lang ngah suh tumjih kotahang ah punpiipi ih thiin ah.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:12</char><char style="fq" closed="false">ngah suh tumjih baat tahang ah maang langlang ah;</char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ngah ih heh suh tumjih baattang ah maang langlang ah. </char></note> <verse number="13" style="v"/>Ngah ih nyoot hala amiisak tiit loong ah an ih dangdang et kap uno enyootsok etjih toom ang uh, eno Kristo Jisu damdoh roop uno heh suh hanpi lam ih nyia minchan nah ban tongruh eh uh. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Seng damdi roong tongte Esa Chiiala, chaan nawa ih sen suh eseejih loong kotahan ah bankap ruh et an.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v"/>An ih jat et hu, Esia juungkhuung nawa mirep ih ngah ah thiinhaat et rum tahang, erah damdi Phiijelus nyia Harmojinis ih nep roong thiinhaat nyu tahang. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Teesu tenthet ah Onisphorus jaatang asuh toom je ah, tumeah heh ih saapoot rookwih kaban chosok wang tahang. Ngah phaatak ni tong angdi uh tarakriita, <verse number="17" style="v"/>erah nang ih bah Room hadaang ni thok haano ngah maang japtup tup jamsok tahang. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Seng Teesu ih heh kaat Rangwuung chang adoh heh suh tenthet minchan ah toom koh ah! Eno an ih rapneene ih jat hu Ephisas ni heh nga raangtaan ih mathan ih reeta rah ah.</para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Jisu Kristo sipaahi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Erah raangtaan ih, nga sah, Kristo Jisu minchan jun ih an tarong ih tong uh. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Ngah ih mina loong haaki haana hantek angrum adi nyootsoot tang loong chaattu ah an ih ekap etheng, eno o mina ih mihoh suh nep we deen nyoot ah ih thunhu erah loong asuh nyoot thuk rum uh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v"/>Jisu Kristo jengchaatchaat ete sipaahi jun ih, an ih echamnaang ah ejen roonghui etheng. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Sipaahi ih heh reeraang pakna tokdoh heh saahaap ah eroonthuk et suh jaat thun ah, eno erah thoih sipaahi lah angka mina mootkaat nah taroong phaklak moka ang ah. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Etootmui soonte ih esoon banlam ah laphanka bah babah uh hethaang tachoka ang ah. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Phek mootte ah mootkaat doh rapne ih chekbekte ang abah cham jaakhoh menla ah roong chokhan ah. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ngah ih tumjih suh liihang ethun et thaak uh, tumeah Teesu ih erah loong ah thoontang emiisamthun etthuk ho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v"/>Ruurang Ese tiit baattang adoh nyootsoot rum taha Jisu Kristo ah samthun uh, Heh Dewid sutoom tek nawa ngaakthingte warah angta. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Tumeah, erah Ruurang Ese tiit tumbaat thoih, ngah ehuh eleek likhiik ih chamnaang khak rum tahang. Enoothong Rangte jengkhaap abah tajen khakka, <verse number="10" style="v"/>eno danje choi mina thoih ih ba jirep ah enaan et hang, tumeah Kristo Jisu jun ih lathoon theng et roorangjih khopiiroidong ah neng ih uh echoh toom eah. <verse number="11" style="v"/>Amiisak tiit arah ah:</para>
  <para style="q1">“Seng Kristo damdoh tek ih ba,</para>
  <para style="q2">Seng uh heh damdoh khothing tong ih.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:12 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 10:33">Mat 10:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:9">Luk 12:9</ref></char>
    </note> Seng ih heh damdoh ban roongnaan ruh et ibah,</para>
  <para style="q2">Seng ih uh heh damdoh roong pan et ih.</para>
  <para style="q1">Seng ih heh ah edaan mok et ih,</para>
  <para style="q2">heh reh uh seng ah edaan et he.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v"/>Seng kamkam latuungmaangke bah,</para>
  <para style="q2">heh tuungmaang ah je ruh ela,</para>
  <para style="q2">tumeah heh teeteewah raang ih heh tamoongtaangka.”</para>
  <para style="s">Mootkaatte ih dan baatcho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>Erah loong tiit ah an mina loong suh banbaat ruh et uh, eno Rangte ngathong nah neng jengkhaap nawa ih larookmui suh dangdang ih baat rum uh. Erah dowa ih ese tabaam dong reeka, erah nang ih eboichaatte ba dong chiike ah. <verse number="15" style="v"/>Rangte jiinko nah an mootkaat ah naririh ih dong moh uh, mootkaatte larakri thang ih moh arah likhiik ah, nyia Rangte amiisak tiit ah epun lam ih nyootte likhiik ah. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Esot tiitwaan nyia thungko taklo tiitwaan nawa haloh ih tong an, erah tiitwaan ih bah mina Rangte jiin nawa ba hiiksiit ah. <verse number="17" style="v"/>Erah jaat tiit nyootsoot mu abah sok ama ih rangkhoh khoop matphak arah likhiik. Erah jaat tiit nyootte wanyi ah Haimenus nyia Philitus. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Nengnyi ih amiisak tiit lam ah thiinhaat nyuuha, eno etekte mararah loong abah ejen ngaaksaat eta ih baat nyu ano hanpiite loong ah thungjoong thuk rumha. <verse number="19" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:5">Erok 6:5</ref></char></note> Enoothong Rangte ih hetangphang rongkop ih hoonta ah o euh tajen mootnyoongka; eno erah di amet raangha: “Teesu ih heh mina o ah erah ejat eha” nyia “O ih neng ah Teesu mina et chaang ha loong ah ih neng reeraang ethih nawa engaaklek ejih jaatjaat ang ah.”</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v"/>Nok elong nah khuung akhaak nyia tek alak hephan dowa je ah: maramarah ah hun akom nawa ih hoon arah, mararah ah hampaak nyia bang nawa ih hoon arah; rukho ah hoondak kaankoong doh maakjih, rukho ah jojang doh maakjih et hoonha. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Erah ethih loong hukkhaak dowa o mina esa jen ang ah, erah loong ah hoondak mootkaat doh maak ah, tumeah neng ah rangsoom nawa ih saasiit ano thiinha eno Changte wah ih maakjih ang ah, nyia jaatrep ese mootkaat doh laanmaak ruh etjih ang rum ah. <verse number="22" style="v"/>Jaaro tenthun ethih nawa epui eh uh, eno o mina neng tenthun esa lam ih neng chosok suh Teesu poon rumha loong ah damdoh; kateng, tuungmaang, minchan nyia semroongroong ih songtong suh roong laatchaat uh. <verse number="23" style="v"/>Enoothong thungko nyia lajatte loong damdoh lathaam daanmu theng; an ih jat et hu erah ih bah changrook ba dongsiit ah. <verse number="24" style="v"/>An Teesu laksuh, erah thoi babah uh lajaatjaat rookmui theng. Mirep damdoh minchan eje angtheng, nyia ese nyia enaan ete nyootte jaatjaat angtheng, <verse number="25" style="v"/>an jeng daante loong suh renbaat udoh toongtang lam ih renbaat uh, tumeah erah loong asuh Rangte ih sekthun thuk rum ano amiisak ah toom dong jatthuk rum ah. <verse number="26" style="v"/>Eno juuba, nengthung ah dongsek ano Juungbaan luungwang phoong nawa puirum ah, neng loong ah heh phoong ni pat rum ano heh jengchaatchaat ang rum dowa.</para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c"/>
  <para style="s">Hethoon saakaan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Samthun et an hethoon sa doh saapoot ah rapne ih chikrok ah. <verse number="2" style="v"/>Mina loong ah nyamrat angrum ah, nyamnyook angrum ah, engaampo erum ah, nyia hahuung doh ngaam rum ah; neng ah ekaanju mina ang ah, nengnuh nengwah jeng lachaatte angrum ah, jengse laraate mina angrum ah, nyia thooroom lajatte angrum ah; <verse number="3" style="v"/>neng doh minchan amuk ang ah, tenthet muh angrum ah, mithet haatte, changrookte angrum ah nyia micho mijo angrum ah; neng ih ese ah echiik et rum ah; <verse number="4" style="v"/>mih mokwaante angrum ah, lih ah ngah lathunte angrum ah, nyia ngaampook ngaamsaang angrum ah; Rangte nang ih neng tenroon theng asuh seechoh rum ah; <verse number="5" style="v"/>neng ih seng thooroom ah rangkhoh nah luulu kap rum ano, amiisak chaan ah thaaju et rum ah. Erah likhiik mina jiin nawa haloh ih tong an. <verse number="6" style="v"/>Neng loong dung dowa ararah ah mih nok ni karum leh rangdah ni neng thetre thoi chamnaang tongte nyia neng tenthun jaatrep ethih ni thun ano larook lata ih tongte minuh loong ah neng lakmong nah thiin rum ah, <verse number="7" style="v"/>erah minuh loong ah ih saarookwih ese ah nyoot suh taat ram rumla ang abah uh neng ih amiisak ah babah uh tajat rumka. <verse number="8" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 7:11">Hpkt 7:11</ref></char></note> Jens nyi Jambres ih uh Moses tiit daan nyuuta ah likhiik, arah mih loong ih uh amiisak ah edaan et rumha— erah miloong thung atak ah naririh tah angka nyia neng tuungmaang uh taje rumka. <verse number="9" style="v"/>Enoothong neng ah haloh nah tajen soon rumka, tumeah neng mathan thungko ah warep ih tup rum ah. Jens nyia Jambres suh mamah angta erah likhiik angta.</para>
  <para style="s">Hethoon hukbaatkot</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v"/>Enoothong an ih bah ngah ih nyoot hala ah phan et hu, nga reeraang pakna, nyia nga roidong thoilam ah phan et hu; nga hanpi ah thoijat et hu, nga ih naanhang ah jat et hu, nga mongnook ah jat et hu, nga ih naanhang ah jat et hu, <verse number="11" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:14-52">Esm 13:14-52</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:1-7">Esm 14:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 14:8-20">Esm 14:8-20</ref></char></note> nga siiwi chamnaang ah jat et hu, nyia nga khoirok ah jat et hu. Entiook, Ikonium nyia Listra ni tumjih angtang loong ah thoontang ejat hu, echo ejih et siiwi chamnaang rum tahang adi mamet naantang rah ah! Rangte ih thong ba erah loong dowa puipang tahang. <verse number="12" style="v"/>Warep mina o Jisu damdi roongroop ano heh roidong ah rangte menjat lam ih tongsong suh nookla loong abah siiwi chamnaang et ah; <verse number="13" style="v"/>eno ethih nyia ese likhiik ih diiphoonte mina loong ah ethih nawa ethithoon ih hoon rum ah, neng teeteewah nyia mihoh loong ah riim mokwaan rum ano ah. <verse number="14" style="v"/>Enoothong anbah, mamet nyoot taha jun ih amiisak tiit asuh ban hanpi ruh etheng. An suh nyootte ah o loong ang rumta an ih jat et hu, <verse number="15" style="v"/>eno noodek tok dowa loong ah an ih samthun et hu, Rangteele Esa dowa ih thungse takmi Jisu Kristo suh hanpi jun ih khopiiroidong lam jen suikoh halu rah ah. <verse number="16" style="v"/>Thoontang Rangteele loong ah Rangte tak alak, erah loong ah amiisak tiit nyootsoot muidoh, emoongtaang eah doh kanja suh, ethet eah doh huk punbaat suh, nyia epun ih songtong thoilam loong ah hukbaat kotmui tokdoh maaktheng ang ah, <verse number="17" style="v"/>eno juuba o Rangte mootkaatte loong ah jaatrep ese ah jen moh suh rapne ejat nyia lathoom laram ang rum ah.</para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c"/>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v"/>Ething nyia tekchoote loong dandeete, Rangte nyia Jisu Kristo luungwang ih hoon raate wah pandi, an suh arah baat hala: <verse number="2" style="v"/>Rangte tiitkhaap ah tumbaat theng, erah tiitkhaap ah rootroot ih baat theng (ethih ese saapoot doh), enyoom lam ih baat theng, mih lachikram theng tiit baat theng, nyia chaankot jengkhaap jeng theng, eno arah tiit ah enaan lam ih baattaan rum uh. <verse number="3" style="v"/>Mina ih rang banlam tiit boichaat suh lanook saapoot ah ethok eha, erah nang ih neng thungpunla lam adoh khoom suh ram rumla nyia neng na ih chochaat suh ram rumla nyootte loong ah ehan ehan ih lomjam rum ah. <verse number="4" style="v"/>Neng ih amiisak tiit chaat ah toorum ano, lalangka hahuung khiikkhi tiit chaat suh nengthung nengtak ah korum ah. <verse number="5" style="v"/>Enoothong an teeteewah ah tumjaat pongwut thok haabah uh naririh ih ban sok uh; cham anaang ah naan et uh, Ruurang Ese tiit baat mootkaat ah moh uh, nyia Rangte laksuh likhiik ih an mootkaat moh uh.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v"/>Enoothong ngadi bah, nga tek haat saapoot ah ethok ehala; arah roidong ah thiinhaat suh saapoot ah amadi ejen thok ih taha. <verse number="7" style="v"/>Ngah etootmui soon di ese thoon ih soontang, mathan soontheng angta haloot thoon ah ngah soontang, ngah tuungmaangjih angta ah uh ngah tuungmaang ruh etang. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">ngah hanpi jeeruh eta;</char><char style="ft" closed="false">adoleh </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nga jengdang amiimi ih kaptang.</char></note> <verse number="8" style="v"/>Eno Rangte damdi epun ih tong thoidi amadi ejen thaangchojih ah amadi ban jeeruh ela, marah kateng lam ih Dandeete, Teesu ih erah Rangwuung ja kohang—eno erah nga luulu suh takoh rang ang ah, enoothong o mina ih minchan damdi heh dongraak ban sok ha erah loong asuh nep koh ah.</para>
  <para style="s">Ngiija jengkhaap</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v"/>Nga jiinnah mathan seek jen ang ih emah ih wangsuh thun uh. <verse number="10" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Kol 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Phm 24</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 8:23">2Kr 8:23</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 2:3">Gal 2:3</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 1:4">Tit 1:4</ref> </char></note> Tumeah Demas ih arah mongrep asuh mongnook ano ngah ah thiinhaat tahang, eno Thesolonika ni kata. Krisen ah Galati ni kata, nyia Taitas ah Dalmatia ni kata. <verse number="11" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="COL 4:14">Kol 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Phm 24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 12:12">Esm 12:12</ref>,<ref loc="ACT 12:25">25</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:13">13:13</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:37-39">15:37-39</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:10">Kol 4:10</ref>; <ref loc="PHM 1:24">Phm 24</ref></char></note>Nga damdi Luk luulu ba je ah. Maak ah jam uno an damdoh waksiit wanho, tumeah heh ba nga mootkaat ah jen roong chosok hang. <verse number="12" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:4">Esm 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:21">Eph 6:21</ref>,<ref loc="EPH 6:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="COL 4:7">Kol 4:7</ref>,<ref loc="COL 4:8">8</ref></char></note> Ngah ih Tiichikas ah Ephisus ni kaat thuktang. <verse number="13" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 20:6">Esm 20:6</ref></char></note> An wang ho doh Troas ni Karpas jiinni nga kut samsong thiinhaat tang ah huiwan et ho; leedap loong ah huiwan et ho, siikhoop nawa hoonta leedap ah tang ah rootroot ih huiwanho.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:14 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1TI 1:20">1Tim 1:20</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 62:12">Rsb 62:12</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:6">Rom 2:6</ref></char>
    </note> Jaanrotte Alekjender ih ngah rapne ih joonnaam tahang; enoothong heh tumjaat reeta thaang ah Teesu ih toom koh ah. <verse number="15" style="v"/>An uh heh dowa pui suh banthun ruh et uh, tumeah heh ih Rangte tiitwaan ah rapne ih ramcham daanta.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v"/>Takkhothoondi nga teewah raangtaan ih laattang adi nga raaruh o uh tajeeta, warep ih thiinhaat rum tahang. Rangte ih erah loong mok re rumta ah neng sak nah naktoom rookwet weekah! <verse number="17" style="v"/>Enoothong Teesu ah nga damdi roongtong haano tathat ah kotahang, eno ba ngah ih Ranglajatte loong suh Rangte tiit ah baat rum angno japchaat thuk rumtang; nyia ngah etek haat etheng dowa puipang tahang. <verse number="18" style="v"/>Eno Teesu ih ngah jaatrep ethih nawa panghang no heh Rangmong Hasong adoh punpuipui ih thoksiit wanhang. Heh juuba babah uh lathoon theng ih rangkaajih! Amen.</para>
  <para style="s">Hethoon jengkhaapse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="ACT 18:2">Esm 18:2</ref>; <ref loc="2TI 1:16">2Tim 1:16</ref>,<ref loc="2TI 1:17">17</ref></char>
    </note> Ngah ih Prisila nyia Ekuila erah damdi Onisphoras jaatang loong suh jengkhaapse maat halang. <verse number="20" style="v"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 19:22">Esm 19:22</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 16:23">Rom 16:23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:4">Esm 20:4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 21:29">21:29</ref></char></note>Erastas ah Korin ni tongta, eno Trophimas ah khoisat ang thoih Melitus hadaang adi thiinhaat tang. <verse number="21" style="v"/>Hahook maang thok ra doh ewang eho doh se ah.</para>
  <para style="p">Ebulus, Puden, Linas nyia Kolaudia erah dam ih wahoh Kristaan phoh ano loong ih nep an suh jengkhaapse maat rum halu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v"/>An chi an la nah Teesu ah an damdam toom tongha.</para>
  <para style="p">Rangte tenthet ah loongtang suh sen damdam toom angha.</para>
</usx>
